### GET EVENT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/sample

### CREATE EVENT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "Hoi Cho Sach 2026",
  "organizerName": "NXB Tre",
  "ticketPrice": 0
}

### POST - CREATE EVENT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "organizerName": "NXB Tre", "ticketPrice": 0 }
  

### Link URL của Controller để vận hành Output: POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/batch — thân request (JSON):

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "eventName": "Hoi Thao AI 2026",  "organizerName": "AI Vietnam",   "ticketPrice": 0 },
  { "eventName": "Trien Lam Anh",     "organizerName": "Studio Sang",  "ticketPrice": 50000 },
  { "eventName": "Khoa Hoc Python",   "organizerName": "Code Academy", "ticketPrice": 1200000 }
]

### GET EVENT BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1


### GET EVENTS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### GET EVENTS FILTERED BY ORGANIZER - Lọc theo nhà tổ chức
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?organizer=Jazz%20Club

### GET EVENTS SEARCH BY KEYWORD - Tìm kiếm theo từ khóa
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/search?keyword=jazz
### GET EVENTS SEARCH BY KEYWORD - Tìm kiếm theo từ khóa (không có kết quả)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/search?keyword=xyz


### PUT EVENT - Cập nhật thông tin sự kiện
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "Dem Nhac Jazz 4",
  "organizerName": "Jazz Club 4",
  "ticketPrice": 380000
}

### C03L08-03: Đổi giá hàng loạt
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/price?organizer=Code%20Academy&newPrice=1000
Content-Type: application/json

### DELETE Event By Id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/2
Content-Type: application/json

### DELETE Event By Id (Không tồn tại)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/999
Content-Type: application/json

### DELETE Events By Organizer
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events?organizer=Code%20Academy

### DELETE Events By Organizer (Thiếu tham số — bị từ chối)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events

### DELETE ALL EVENTS
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/all
Content-Type: application/json
